# No Claude models unless requested

Never select or spawn Anthropic Claude for this project — including any `claude-*` slug, Sonnet, Opus, Haiku, or any model name that includes "Claude" — for this chat, workers, subagents, or `CreateAgent` `model`, unless the user **explicitly** names Claude or a `claude-*` model in that same request.

When choosing a model:

- Prefer the parent or inherited model for the current agent.
- Otherwise default to Grok or `composer-2.5` (or another non-Claude model available in context).

Do not infer consent from prior turns, project defaults, or task difficulty. If the user did not name Claude in the request, do not use Claude.
